100 training examples, 100 features, 5 of them real

   epoch  train loss  holdout loss
       1       0.683         0.689
      10       0.616         0.665
      50       0.456         0.621
      94       0.373         0.612   <- best holdout
     200       0.275         0.632
     400       0.194         0.697
     800       0.124         0.820

Training loss fell every epoch, to 0.124. Holdout loss was lowest at epoch 94
(0.612) and 1.3x that by epoch 800. After the best epoch the model was
learning the noise in 100 examples, and only the holdout could see it.
